## Test Case 4: Verify all images are loaded successfully

| Field | Details |
|---|---|
| Test Case ID | TC-LOGIN-004 |
| Test Scenario | Verify validation when the password field is empty |
| Preconditions | The user is on the login page |
| Steps | 1. Open the target webpage using Selenium.<br>2. Locate all <img> elements on the webpage.<br>3. Retrieve each image's src attribute.<br>4. Check whether each image is loaded successfully.<br4>5. Check whether each image is loaded successfully.<br5>6. Record the source URL of each broken image. |
| Expected Result | The system should show "Password is required." |
| Actual Result | The system shows "Invalid email or password" instead of "Password is required." |
| Status | Fail |
